        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under nitrogen, a solution of [Ce(LOEt)Cl3] (1; 80.5 mg, 0.103 mmol) in MeCN (5 mL) was treated with a suspension of [Ag2MoO4] (58 mg, 0.155 mmol) in MeCN (5 mL) at −30 °C, then stirred at room temperature overnight. AgCl was filtered off and volatiles were removed in vacuo. The orange residue was extracted with CH2Cl2 and recrystallized from CH2Cl2/Et2O at −18 °C to give orange single crystals identified as previously reported 2 by single-crystal X-ray diffraction.",
